        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I ordered Bot9 on Tue Nov 17th.</p><p>On Fri Dec 4th I received a message from FedEx (because I&#39;d signed up with FedEx for notifications via FedEx SmartPost, i think) that my package was due to be delivered on Thu Dec 10th.</p><p>I received Bot9 on Thu Dec 10th.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, it seems a bit surprising that if they sent your package two weeks ago you didn&#39;t get it by the end of the week, but I could envision a scenario where they sent it the very end of the week and it&#39;s going to show up today or tomorrow or something. Or maybe they were over optimistic about when they&#39;d be able to send it. Or maybe something else happened, of course.</p>",
